8:appear among the four p. 373 gives\ncase-study--nedobyvailov-light-heavy-and-combined-loads-in-jumpers.md:18:power GP1 about 6, GP2 about 14, GP3 about 20\ncase-study--nedobyvailov-light-heavy-and-combined-loads-in-jumpers.md:18:speed GP1 about 18,\ncase-study--nedobyvailov-light-heavy-and-combined-loads-in-jumpers.md:18:GP2 about 18, GP3 about 17\ncase-study--nedobyvailov-light-heavy-and-combined-loads-in-jumpers.md:26:power rose about 20% in the 30-90% group against about 14%\ncase-study--nedobyvailov-light-heavy-and-combined-loads-in-jumpers.md:24:(about 18%)\nheuristic--routine-artificial-restoration-can-blunt-adaptation.md:20:Inference: removing that disturbance too early\nheuristic--routine-artificial-restoration-can-blunt-adaptation.md:24:statistics. The text says\nheuristic--routine-artificial-restoration-can-blunt-adaptation.md:24:but not whether in both groups or only the restoration group\nheuristic--routine-artificial-restoration-can-blunt-adaptation.md:26:without saying in which group\nprinciple--loading-volume-disturbs-homeostasis-and-prepares-connective-tissue.md:18:inappropriate to use highly stimulating means prematurely\nclaim--middle-distance-runners-need-strength-and-jump-training-benchmarks.md:18:not only conform to, but exceed, competition\nclaim--middle-distance-runners-need-strength-and-jump-training-benchmarks.md:18:The emergence of specificity from an array of non-specific fitness qualities\n```\n\nBlank line before Example in the restoration entry: line 25 is empty, and line 26 is `**Example** — ...`.\n\nOld phrases, count of scoped files still holding each (all 0):\n\n```\nmonth 1.3 to about month 4.3: 0\nThe Addendum restates: 0\nThe authors' own, from the Addendum: 0\nnot as a documented LDTE.: 0\nTheir conclusion, italicised: 0\nChapter 5 states fixed orders: 0\nso the 4-6 weeks is a minimum: 0\non PDF p. 372 \"glycolytic-anaerobic exercises follow large volumes of aerobic work\" is listed: 0\nGP3 about 21: 0\nabout 18-19: 0\nabout 6