s with different training potential (A, B, C). \nHowever, it is inappropriate to use highly stimulating means prematurely, because the body is functionally\n357","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"04b8fec1-1cb7-495b-a59b-8f0ec5e0f16a","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
