-jumps concurrently \n48-throughout both 3-month stages. The overall volume of the loading was equivalent in all groups.\n--\n53:1. The partial TE of the depth-jumping is greater than that of the barbell exercises.\n54-353","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0371bf0a-add8-451c-ac36-c61a9c32fe4e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
